    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. i know you say that but it doesn't feel true. like, if you actually exist, you leave a mark on people, right? people react to you. but there's just nothing. no notifications, no one asking how i am, nothing. it’s just this heavy silence. it feels more real than the stuff they tell me in therapy. like i'm already gone, i'm just waiting for my body to catch up to the fact.",
